sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant IF as IF
    participant ID as ID
    participant EX as EX
    participant MEM as MEM
    participant WB as WB commit controller
    participant CSR as csr_regfile
    participant PC as IF PC mux
    participant HZ as hazard_unit

    Note over ID,WB: Precise synchronous exception flows with the instruction

    ID->>EX: exc_valid, exc_cause, exc_tval, exc_pc propagate
    EX->>MEM: same sideband preserved
    MEM->>WB: final sideband preserved

    loop while exception is in flight
        WB->>HZ: flush_pipeline_onehot = 4'b1111? no, not yet
        HZ->>ID: FlushD = 1 for younger instructions
        HZ->>EX: FlushE = 1 when exception reaches MEM
    end

    WB->>WB: trap_commit = valid_W & exc_valid_W
    WB->>CSR: trap_valid, trap_cause, trap_pc, trap_addr, trap_addr_valid
    WB->>PC: wb_trap_redirect = 1, trap_target = mtvec.BASE
    WB->>HZ: flush_pipeline_onehot = 4'b1111
    CSR->>CSR: write mepc = exc_pc_W
    CSR->>CSR: write mcause = {1'b0, exc_cause_W}
    CSR->>CSR: write mtval = exc_tval_W or 0
    CSR->>CSR: mstatus.MIE <- 0, MPIE <- old MIE, MPP <- 11
    PC->>IF: redirect fetch to mtvec
    WB-->>IF: younger instructions removed from pipeline
